  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Terekeka Peanut Paste and Cooking Oil Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Peanuts Town/City: Terekeka, South Sudan Summary: The project will enable Organic Cooking Oil Company Limited to increase purchases of peanuts from farmer members and professionalize its peanut paste and oil processing operation. The grantee will purchase processing equipment and a vehicle, build a storage facility, receive training in areas such as financial management, governance, agronomy, and will attend an exchange visit to learn from a more established peanut marketing business. This project will increase incomes for famers and strengthen the cooperative&apos;s ability to market peanut products.</narrative>
  </description>
